  "method": [
    "Read SQLite in one mode=ro transaction. Completed fields are valid or have reached three attempts. Costs include all attempts.",
    "Allocate each paid request across its existing memberships to prevent double-counting cached content.",
    "Match each field to the identical scenario/sample/target/view in its same-seed parent: M for MthenS/MthenN, S for SthenM/SthenN, and the M/S mean for mixed. Solo arms use base.",
    "Within each arm/seed/battery, divide completed costs by matched parent costs. Apply this ratio to remaining parent fields. Unobserved seed groups use the equal-weight mean of observed same-arm seed ratios.",
